    ok("!! the check texts are word for word where the mutation pass found them loose: (0, 1), a scripted lost run scores 0, the 72 train ids in the ID SETS text, the champion row's 1800 and the stored arms row's 1800", R0.some((l) => l === "  PASS SCORES INSIDE (0, 1): no score outside (0, 1): true") && R0.some((l) => /scripted lost run scores 0 \(0\.65 expected\): true$/.test(l)) && R0.some((l) => l === "  PASS ID SETS DISJOINT, THE AUDIT PAST EVERY EARLIER ONE: the audit ids do not overlap the 72 train ids (26000-26023 and 30000-30047) or the held-out ids 26100-26139, and start after H66's audit (86399): true") && R0.some((l) => l === "  PASS EACH GROUP'S CHAMPION IS THE BEST HELD-OUT PENALISED OF ITS FOUR AT 1800: each group's champion at 1800 has the largest held-out penalised value of its four seeds (the first of a tie in seed order): true") && R0.some((l) => l === "  PASS THE S02 ARMS ARE H32'S 1800-ITERATION NETWORKS AND THE A02 AND B02 ARMS H39'S: s02_26011 to s02_26014 are the weights at 1800 of H32's stored search (s02_26011 its champion by H32's rule), and a02_26011 to a02_26014 and b02_26011 to b02_26014 those of H39's stored A02 and B02 searches: true"));
